"Preferences->Tweaks"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid "Speedup calibre shutdown time by a couple of seconds"
msgstr "Zrýchlenie vypínania calibre o niekoľko sekúnd"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid "04 Dec, 2025"
msgstr "4. decembra 2025"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid ""
"Allow asking AI questions about any book in your calibre library. Right "
"click the \"View\" button and choose \"Discuss selected book(s) with AI\""
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje klásť AI otázky o ľubovoľnej knihe vo vašej knižnici calibre. "
