#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid "21 Nov, 2025"
msgstr "21. novembra 2025"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid ""
"E-book viewer: Highlights panel: Show the date for highlights in the tooltip"
" when hovering over a highlight"
msgstr ""
"Prehliadač e-kníh: Panel zvýraznení: Zobraziť dátum zvýraznení v tipe pri "
"umiestnení myši na zvýraznenie"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid ""
"Comments editor: When changing case preserve as much text formatting as "
