#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid ""
"Fix a regression in 8.11 that caused errors when trying to open a book from "
"the full text search results while the search was still running"
msgstr ""
"Oprava regresie vo verzii 8.11, ktorá spôsobovala chyby pri pokuse otvoriť "
