"prebiehalo"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid "01 Oct, 2025"
msgstr "1. októbra 2025"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid "Tolino driver: Support for latest Tolino firmware 5.11.230427"
msgstr "Ovládač Tolino: Podpora pre najnovší firmvér Tolino 5.11.230427"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid ""
"Ollama AI: Allow setting arbitrary HTTP headers to send with every request"
msgstr ""
"Ollama AI: Umožňuje nastaviť ľubovoľné HTTP hlavičky na odoslanie s každou "
"požiadavkou"

#: Changelog.yaml:0
msgid ""
"Fix a regression in the previous release that broke conversion of HTML that "
